tury 复古旅行海报的印刷质感与轻微纸张肌理。\n\n画面构图与元素（元素自然关联，形成「海面 - 沙滩 - 贝壳珠宝」的场景逻辑）：\n\n- 整体竖版构图，边缘带浅米白色复古海报边\n- 顶部区域：湖蓝色天空背景，上方是白色大号复古衬线字体「INDONESIA」，下方配白色小字「The Vibrant July Edition」，文字带一条黄色装饰弧线\n- 左上区域：扁平化海上日落场景，橙黄色圆形落日，蓝色海面带有金色落日反光，远处绿色低矮岛屿；海面上漂浮一艘印尼传统木质帆船，船身黑色、船顶黄色\n- 右上区域：黑色剪影的巴厘岛传统凉亭，旁侧一棵深绿色椰子树；下方拼接红白建筑色块与一块绿色印尼巴迪克蜡染几何纹样色块\n- 下半部分：暖黄色沙滩底色，视觉核心是一枚打开的乳白色大贝壳，贝壳内安放银色马头吊坠；贝壳周围散落橙红色珊瑚、白色鸡蛋花（印尼国花）、大小海星、小珍珠，均为扁平化插画风格\n- 底部正中央：白色复古衬线字体「OROLA」\n\n整体色彩：高饱和复古配色，主色为湖蓝、橙红、明黄、墨绿、米白；银饰保留真实金属磨砂质感，与扁平插画背景形成材质对比。", "empty", false, 2135802719, "randomize", "1k"], "inputs": [{"name": "image1", "link": 2, "label": "image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image2", "label": "image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image3", "label": "image3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image3"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image4", "label": "image4", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image4"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image5", "label": "image5", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image5"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image6", "label": "image6", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image6"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image7", "label": "image7", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image7"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image8", "label": "image8", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image8"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image9", "label": "image9", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image9"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image10", "label": "image10", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image10"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "api_config", "label": "api_config", "type": "RH_OPENAPI_CONFIG", "localized_name": "api_config"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "aspectRatio"}, "shape": 7, "name": "aspectRatio", "label": "aspectRatio", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "aspectRatio"}, {"widget": {"name": "skip_error"}, "shape": 7, "name": "skip_error", "label": "skip_error", "type": "BOOL